{"id":"b78092e29a02d697","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-numeral.md","title":"Numeral $\bar{n}$","display":"df-numeral — Numeral $\bar{n}$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-numeral","aliases":["92-df-numeral"],"display":"df-numeral — Numeral $\bar{n}$","depends_on":["[[92-df-term]]"],"source":"本地算术语法；对照原书第 II 章 pp.14–19 和第 III 章 pp.28–30；本库 token 编码及 Hilbert 呈现与原书原生语言不同","source_status":"原书相关概念的本地语法实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-numeral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-numeral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-numeral — Numeral <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\bar{n}\">\\(\bar{n}\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术语法；对照原书第 II 章 pp.14–19 和第 III 章 pp.28–30；本库 token 编码及 Hilbert 呈现与原书原生语言不同"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关概念的本地语法实现"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-numeral-—-Numeral-$\\bar{n}$\">df-numeral — Numeral <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n}\">\\(\\bar{n}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (natural number)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span> (term set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{\\cdot}\">\\(\\bar{\\cdot}\\)</span> (definition-target numeral map)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral} \\vdash \\bar{\\cdot}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\qquad \\bar0\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S(\\bar n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral} \\vdash \\bar{\\cdot}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\qquad \\bar0\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S(\\bar n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n}\">\\(\\bar{n}\\)</span> : 自然数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>的形式化 numeral</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> : 后继符号 (successor)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> : 零符号</li>\n<li>numeral 将自然数编码为系统G中的项</li>\n<li>这是算术化的基础：自然数 → 形式项</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-numeral-—-Numeral-$\\bar{n}$","text":"df-numeral — Numeral $\\bar{n}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_G$ (term set, see [[92-df-term]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\bar{n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{n}","display":false},{"tex":"n \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{\\cdot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral} \\vdash \\bar{\\cdot}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\qquad \\bar0\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\ov